{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12201240","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12201240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:5:1220124001:0":{"text":"... 사... 세시...","source_cn":"……萨……赛西……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C95B0E235D02D1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220124002:0":{"text":"정말, 이렇게 오래 기다리게 하는 게 어딨어!","source_cn":"真是的，居然让我等了这么久！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB02198FA7930AC39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220124003:0":{"text":"아… 아...","source_cn":"啊……啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE884EE72FDDD0CFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220124004:0":{"text":"... 응... 나도 많이 보고 싶었어.","source_cn":"……嗯，我也很想你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x141D5A7ACDD93DFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220124005:0":{"text":"우리 모습을 좀 봐. 우리 둘 다 이런 꼴이 되었으니 더 이상 도망가지 마, 알았지?","source_cn":"你瞧，我们现在都已经是这个样子了，就别再逃跑啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE43B169D64DF261","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220124006:0":{"text":"... 세실... 리아...","source_cn":"……塞西……莉亚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5A0BAB1A0931051","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220124007:0":{"text":"... 오히려... 잘됐네. 이참에, 우리네 지금 떠날까?","source_cn":"……不过，正好。趁现在的机会，我们要不要出发呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x454CD656D987DD1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220124008:0":{"text":"멀리 모험을 떠나고 싶어 했잖아. 노랫말처럼 황금빛 들녘을 눈에 담고, 폭포와 무지개를 가로지르고, 대륙을 갈라놓은 협곡도 구경하고 싶어 했잖아, 맞지?","source_cn":"你一直想去远方冒险，就像歌里唱的那样，去看金色的原野，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29FF6219DA8A6295","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220124009:0":{"text":"그동안 많이 참았지? 이제 방문도 열렸고, 더는 네 발목을 잡는 것도 없어. 내가 당신과 같이 갈게.","source_cn":"你已经等了这么久。现在房门的锁已经打开了，再没有东西能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35CB1890789AD929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220124010:0":{"text":"정말 멋지고 기나긴 인생을 우리 둘이 함께할 거야.","source_cn":"我们会一起度过非常漫长，非常精彩的人生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE083D817BE7335B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220124011:0":{"text":"... 아아... 세실... 리아...","source_cn":"……啊啊……塞西……莉亚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8A474A2220C5125","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220124012:0":{"text":"선량한 마법사님, 정말 감사해요. 저와 조나단은 이제 영원한 모험을 떠날 거예요.","source_cn":"善良的魔法师。谢谢你们。我和乔纳森要走了。这会是一场永...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFED8B3412C894399","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"선량한 마법사님, 정말 감사해요. 저와 조나단은 이제 영원한 모험을 떠날 거예요.","female":"선량한 마법사님, 정말 감사해요. 저와 조나단은 이제 영원한 모험을 떠날 거예요.","variant_male_record_index":"131463","variant_female_record_index":"131464","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220124013:0":{"text":"자, 조나단. 우리 출발하자!","source_cn":"来吧，乔纳森，我们一起出发吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x768990D37259FDBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220124014:0":{"text":"... 동경하던 먼 곳을 향해.","source_cn":"……向远方去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC3868C683C7AC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:25:12020138:0":{"text":"세실리아는 《먼 곳을 향해》를 부르며 조나단과 함께 먼 바다로 떠났다.","source_cn":"塞西莉亚唱着那首《向远方去》，和乔纳森一起融入了茫茫的大海。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4C402BD9A3CAB36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narrati